<title>MOLDOVA: Moldovan leu edges down to 4.613 per dollar.</title>
<headline>Moldovan leu edges down to 4.613 per dollar.</headline>
<dateline>CHISINAU 1997-04-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Moldovan leu edged down to 4.613 to the dollar on the Moldovan Interbank Currency Exchange from 4.611 on Tuesday.</p>
<p>				    April 17		April 15</p>
<p> lei per dollar		 4.613		   4.611</p>
<p> volume traded ($)	    50,000		  100,000</p>
